1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,280
(Sheldon:)This is Greek food?

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,350
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you hate Greek food.

3
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:06,920
(Leonard:)Not as much as you.

4
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:14,760
(Sheldon:)Fine. I'm nothing
if not adaptable.

5
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:19,000
(Leonard:)I got you the
lamb kabob.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,030
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

7
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,960
(Sheldon:)If you think about it,

8
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:45,690
(Sheldon:)Greek food isn't that far
from Italian food.

9
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:48,230
(Sheldon:)They share a spice palette.

10
00:00:53,600 --> 00:01:02,020
(Sheldon:)And what a civilization
is the Greeks'!

